<title>USA: GOLF-LEADING SCORES AT BUICK OPEN.</title>
<headline>GOLF-LEADING SCORES AT BUICK OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>GRAND BLANC, Michigan 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores at</p>
<p>the $1.5 million Buick Open PGA golf tournament after the</p>
<p>second round on Friday (players U.S. unless stated):</p>
<p>131 Ernie Els (South Africa) 68 63</p>
<p>135 Dan Forsman 68 67</p>
<p>136 John Morse 67 69, Chris Perry 67 69, Brad Fabel 69 67,</p>
<p>Lanny Wadkins 67 69, Hal Sutton 67 69, Allen Doyle 69 67</p>
<p>137 Larry Mize 68 69, Russ Cochran 68 69, Payne Stewart 72 65</p>
<p>Additional non U.S. players</p>
<p>138 Joe Ozaki (Japan) 67 71</p>
<p>139 Rafael Alarcon (Mexico) 67 72</p>
<p>140 Frank Nobilo (New Zealand) 69 71, Vijay Singh (Fiji) 67</p>
<p>73</p>
<p>141 Steve Elkington (Australia) 70 71</p>
<p>142 Grant Waite (New Zealand) 74 68</p>
</text>
